Subject: [PATCH 27/29] KitKat UI: P16 Tier 2-5 closure + P17 header flip

Calendar port DONE+VERIFIED+FORKED+PINNED (full framework-lib dependency
set vendored; Holo-Light 4.4 look verified on device, zero FATALs).
Dialer/Contacts: evaluated - ship modern (telecom risk ruling).
Gallery/Camera: deferred to focused batch (documented). Browser:
ratified no-port. PackageInstaller: verified already-Holo via P1
cascade. Tier 4/5: closed. Manifest section: all nine pins complete,
PRODUCT_PACKAGES stable, donor reference list complete. 14.11
document-deferred. No [ ] items remain outside deferred/hardware passes.
